{
    "name": "allinone-tv",
    "display_name": "AllinOne IPTV",
    "description": "对应海报条目：IPTv 在线直播（视源稳定性而定）。AllinOne（肥羊）是免维护的 IPTV 直播源聚合工具，自动聚合电视直播、轮播、咪咕等 m3u 源并可搭配自动更新，生成订阅地址供 Kodi、VLC、TiviMate 等播放器使用，直播可用性视源稳定性而定。",
    "category": "movie",
    "tags": ["影视", "IPTV", "直播", "m3u", "聚合"],
    "website": "https://hub.docker.com/r/youshandefeiyang/allinone",
    "source_url": "https://hub.docker.com/r/youshandefeiyang/allinone",
    "architectures": ["amd64", "arm64"],
    "image": "youshandefeiyang/allinone",
    "default_ports": [
        {"port": 35455, "protocol": "tcp", "description": "Web / 订阅服务端口"}
    ],
    "config_schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["ports"],
        "containers": [
            {
                "name": "allinone-tv",
                "title": "AllinOne IPTV",
                "settings": [
                    {"type": "ports", "title": "端口设置", "fields": ["ports"]},
                    {"type": "env", "title": "环境变量", "fields": ["allinone_env"]},
                    {"type": "advanced", "title": "高级设置", "fields": ["privileged"]}
                ],
                "description": "AllinOne IPTV 直播源聚合"
            }
        ],
        "properties": {
            "ports": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": ["local_port", "container_port", "protocol"],
                    "properties": {
                        "protocol": {"enum": ["tcp", "udp"], "type": "string", "title": "协议", "default": "tcp"},
                        "local_port": {"type": "integer", "title": "本地端口", "maximum": 65535, "minimum": 1},
                        "container_port": {"type": "integer", "title": "容器端口", "maximum": 65535, "minimum": 1}
                    }
                },
                "title": "端口设置",
                "default": [
                    {"protocol": "tcp", "local_port": 35455, "container_port": 35455}
                ]
            },
            "allinone_env": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": ["key", "value"],
                    "properties": {
                        "key": {"type": "string", "title": "变量名"},
                        "value": {"type": "string", "title": "值"}
                    }
                },
                "title": "环境变量",
                "default": [
                    {"key": "TZ", "value": "Asia/Shanghai"}
                ]
            },
            "privileged": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "title": "特权模式",
                "default": true,
                "description": "官方推荐开启特权模式运行"
            }
        }
    },
    "yaml_template": "services:\n  allinone:\n    image: {{ image }}\n    container_name: {{ project_name }}\n    ports:\n{%- for port in ports %}\n      - \"{{ port.local_port }}:{{ port.container_port }}/{{ port.protocol }}\"\n{%- endfor %}\n    privileged: {{ privileged | lower }}\n    restart: unless-stopped\n{%- if allinone_env %}\n    environment:\n{%- for item in allinone_env %}\n      - {{ item.key }}={{ item.value }}\n{%- endfor %}\n{%- endif %}\n",
    "readme": "# AllinOne IPTV\n\n对应海报条目：IPTv 在线直播（视源稳定性而定）。\n\nAllinOne（肥羊）是一款免维护的 IPTV 直播源聚合工具，自动聚合电视直播、轮播、咪咕视频等 m3u 直播源，生成统一的订阅地址，供各类播放器直接使用。直播可用性视源稳定性而定。\n\n## 部署前准备\n\n1. 默认端口 `35455`，如有冲突请修改本地端口。\n2. 官方推荐开启特权模式（已默认开启）。\n3. 如需镜像自动更新，可自行搭配 Watchtower 使用。\n\n## 使用\n\n部署完成后访问 `http://<NAS-IP>:35455` 查看可用接口，常用订阅地址：\n\n- 聚合直播：`http://<NAS-IP>:35455/tv.m3u`\n- 咪咕直播：`http://<NAS-IP>:35455/migu.m3u`\n\n将 m3u 地址导入 Kodi、VLC、TiviMate 或电视盒子播放器即可观看。",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "type": "compose",
    "changelog": "初始导入",
    "backup_paths": [],
    "is_builtin": false
}
